Frank, where'd you get
all that money?

1897
01:40:04,446 --> 01:40:06,198
Brenda, listen. A name, right?

1898
01:40:06,198 --> 01:40:07,365
A name, it doesn't matter.

1899
01:40:07,365 --> 01:40:08,658
My name is Frank Conners, right?

1900
01:40:08,658 --> 01:40:09,909
- That's who I am with you.
- Yes.

1901
01:40:09,909 --> 01:40:11,203
But-but we all have secrets.

1902
01:40:11,203 --> 01:40:12,704
You know,
sometimes when I travel

1903
01:40:12,704 --> 01:40:14,998
I use the name Frank Taylor.
That-That's my secret.

1904
01:40:14,998 --> 01:40:17,041
- Frank Taylor?!
- Yeah, Frank Taylor, you know?

1905
01:40:17,041 --> 01:40:18,251
- Frank Black.
- Frank Black?!

1906
01:40:18,251 --> 01:40:19,461
Yeah, it doesn't matter.

1907
01:40:19,461 --> 01:40:22,172
Why are you saying all this?

1908
01:40:22,172 --> 01:40:24,924
Brenda... Brenda, I don't want
to lie to you anymore.

1909
01:40:24,924 --> 01:40:26,468
All right? I'm not a doctor.

1910
01:40:26,468 --> 01:40:28,220
I never went to medical school.

1911
01:40:28,220 --> 01:40:30,972
I'm not a lawyer or a Harvard
graduate or a Lutheran.

1912
01:40:30,972 --> 01:40:33,558
Brenda, I ran away from home
a year and a half ago

1913
