1914
01:40:35,435 --> 01:40:38,230
Frank...

1915
01:40:38,230 --> 01:40:40,565
Frank?

1916
01:40:40,565 --> 01:40:42,567
You're not a Lutheran?

1917
01:40:42,567 --> 01:40:45,069
Brenda... you see
all this money?

1918
01:40:45,069 --> 01:40:47,071
You see all this money?
I have more.

1919
01:40:47,071 --> 01:40:49,741
I have plenty more.

1920
01:40:49,741 --> 01:40:50,742
I have enough money

1921
01:40:50,742 --> 01:40:52,702
