1985
01:45:27,477 --> 01:45:29,979
For the last six months, he's
gone to Harvard and Berkeley.

1986
01:45:29,979 --> 01:45:31,397
I'm betting he can get
a passport.

1987
01:45:31,397 --> 01:45:33,233
so we have all our men
waiting for him here

1988
01:45:33,233 --> 01:45:34,234
