1989
01:45:34,234 --> 01:45:36,027
He's used it before.
He knows the layout.

1990
01:45:36,027 --> 01:45:37,946
I talked to Miami police;
they've offered us

1991
01:45:37,946 --> 01:45:39,656
50 uniformed cops
in two shifts of 25.

1992
01:45:39,656 --> 01:45:41,825
With our guys, that's almost
100 men in one airport.

1993
01:45:41,825 --> 01:45:43,660
Don't you think
we should spread it around?

1994
01:45:43,660 --> 01:45:45,286
No, no, this is the exit point.

1995
01:45:45,286 --> 01:45:47,540
Well, how do you know
he hasn't rented a car

1996
01:45:47,540 --> 01:45:49,833
and driven to airports
in New York, Atlanta?

1997
01:45:49,833 --> 01:45:51,334
Because I'm not in New York.

1998
01:45:51,334 --> 01:45:52,627
I'm not in Atlanta.

1999
01:45:52,627 --> 01:45:54,546
Yes, this is, uh, Frank Roberts

2000
01:45:54,546 --> 01:45:56,673
and I'm letting
all the universities

2001
01:45:56,673 --> 01:45:59,509
in the area know
that Pan Am will be initiating

2002
01:45:59,509 --> 01:46:01,594
a new recruiting program
this year.

2003
01:46:01,594 --> 01:46:04,889
I'II, uh, be stopping
by your campus tomorrow morning.

2004
01:46:04,889 --> 01:46:08,017
Thank you all very much
for coming.

2005
01:46:08,017 --> 01:46:09,227
At the end of the day

2006
01:46:09,227 --> 01:46:12,313
I'll be choosing eight
young ladies to be a part of...

2007
01:46:14,023 --> 01:46:16,818
...Pan Am's future stewardess
flight crew program.

2008
01:46:16,818 --> 01:46:19,446
Now, these eight young ladies
will accompany me

2009
01:46:19,446 --> 01:46:22,490
on a two-month public relations
tour through Europe.

2010
01:46:23,867 --> 01:46:26,578
They will discover firsthand
what it takes

2011
01:46:26,578 --> 01:46:28,663
to be a Pan American stewardess.

2012
01:46:30,582 --> 01:46:33,209
Give me at least two men...

2013
01:46:33,209 --> 01:46:35,753
Nah, one man
per every two counters.

2014
01:46:35,753 --> 01:46:37,213
- Mm-hmm.
- All right?

2015
01:46:37,213 --> 01:46:38,715
Amdursky?

2016
01:46:38,715 --> 01:46:40,717
Yeah?

2017
01:46:40,717 --> 01:46:42,886
Make sure your uniforms
are covering

2018
