2020
01:46:49,058 --> 01:46:50,810
You, here.

2021
01:46:50,810 --> 01:46:54,689
What qualifies me
to be a future stewardess?

2022
01:46:54,689 --> 01:46:57,776
Well, I think
that I'm really friendly

2023
01:46:57,776 --> 01:46:59,569
and I can really help out

2024
01:46:59,569 --> 01:47:02,739
and, um, make people
feel welcome on the plane and...

2025
01:47:02,739 --> 01:47:05,283
We'll be traveling
at 6,000 miles per hour

2026
01:47:05,283 --> 01:47:06,993
at an altitude of 300 feet.

2027
01:47:06,993 --> 01:47:12,165
All my bags are packed,
I'm ready to go...

2028
01:47:14,501 --> 01:47:15,919
Ilene Anderson.

2029
01:47:23,384 --> 01:47:25,637
Miggy Acker.

2030
01:47:29,891 --> 01:47:32,435
Debra Jo McMillan.

2031
01:47:38,274 --> 01:47:40,527
Candy Heston.

2032
01:47:40,527 --> 01:47:48,368
Come fly with me,
let's fly, let's fly away

2033
01:47:48,368 --> 01:47:51,538
If you can use
some exotic booze

2034
01:47:51,538 --> 01:47:55,125
There's a bar in far Bombay

2035
01:47:55,125 --> 01:48:02,715
Come fly with me,
let's fly, let's fly away

2036
01:48:02,715 --> 01:48:07,011
Come fly with me,
let's float down to Peru

2037
01:48:09,431 --> 01:48:12,559
In Ilama land
there's a one-man band

2038
01:48:12,559 --> 01:48:15,645
And he'll toot his flute
for you

2039
01:48:17,522 --> 01:48:18,690
Come fly with me...

2040
01:48:18,690 --> 01:48:19,858
Hi.

2041
01:48:19,858 --> 01:48:22,485
...Let's take off
