2042
01:48:22,485 --> 01:48:26,030
Once I get you up there

2043
01:48:26,030 --> 01:48:28,241
Where the air is rarefied

2044
01:48:30,577 --> 01:48:36,749
We'll just glide starry-eyed

2045
01:48:36,749 --> 01:48:39,752
Once I get you up there...

2046
01:48:39,752 --> 01:48:41,254
You see that blonde out front?

2047
01:48:41,254 --> 01:48:42,422
I should have been a pilot.

2048
01:48:42,422 --> 01:48:44,257
Exactly.

2049
01:48:44,257 --> 01:48:45,718
Mr. Carl Hanratty

2050
01:48:45,718 --> 01:48:47,218
please pick up
the courtesy telephone.

2051
01:48:47,218 --> 01:48:48,428
Hanratty.

2052
