2057
01:48:57,229 --> 01:48:58,438
He's got his pilot's cap on.

2058
01:48:58,438 --> 01:48:59,689
Carl, I think it's him!

2059
01:48:59,689 --> 01:49:01,983
...Just say the words,
and we'll beat the birds

2060
01:49:01,983 --> 01:49:03,443
Down to Acapulco Bay...

2061
01:49:04,903 --> 01:49:06,404
Watch out, watch out,
watch out!

2062
01:49:06,404 --> 01:49:10,241
...It's perfect for a flying
